---
// 注意力机制演进：三条主线，各一张独立时间线（横轴年份，箭头标方向）
---
<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 560" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <marker id="tl-arrow" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L9,5 L0,10 Z" fill="#0e87a6"></path>
      </marker>
      <filter id="tl-shadow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="160%">
        <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="4" flood-color="#0b2a3a" flood-opacity="0.08"></feDropShadow>
      </filter>
    </defs>

    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="300" y="26" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">注意力机制演进：三条主线（沿时间轴向右发展）</text>

      <!-- ============ 主线 ①：基础与高效计算（蓝） ============ -->
      <text x="20" y="62" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0e87a6">① 基础 &amp; 高效计算（精确、更好算）</text>
      <line x1="30" y1="92" x2="560" y2="92" stroke="#bcdce7" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#tl-arrow)"></line>
      {[
        { x: 90,  y: '2017', t: 'MHA（Transformer）',          c: '#0e87a6' },
        { x: 290, y: '2022', t: 'FlashAttention（精确·IO 感知）', c: '#0e87a6' },
        { x: 470, y: '2023–24', t: 'FA-2 / Ring Attention（多卡分块）', c: '#0e87a6' },
      ].map((n) => (
        <g>
          <line x1={n.x} y1="80" x2={n.x} y2="104" stroke="#bcdce7" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
          <circle cx={n.x} cy="92" r="6" fill="#fff" stroke={n.c} stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
          <text x={n.x} y="120" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">{n.y}</text>
          <text x={n.x} y="136" font-size="9.8" fill="#5b7a86" text-anchor="middle">{n.t}</text>
        </g>
      ))}

      <!-- ============ 主线 ②：降复杂度 稀疏/线性（紫） ============ -->
      <text x="20" y="212" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6d5bd0">② 降复杂度：稀疏 / 线性（长序列，偏学术）</text>
      <line x1="30" y1="242" x2="560" y2="242" stroke="#cfc6f2" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#tl-arrow)"></line>
      {[
        { x: 80,  y: '2019', t: 'Sparse\nTransformer', c: '#6d5bd0' },
        { x: 210, y: '2020', t: 'Longformer / BigBird\nLinformer / Performer', c: '#6d5bd0' },
        { x: 360, y: '2020+', t: '滑窗 / 低秩思想\n被工程继承', c: '#6d5bd0' },
        { x: 500, y: '2025', t: 'DeepSeek NSA\n原生稀疏', c: '#a04bd0' },
      ].map((n) => (
        <g>
          <line x1={n.x} y1="230" x2={n.x} y2="254" stroke="#cfc6f2" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
          <circle cx={n.x} cy="242" r="6" fill="#fff" stroke={n.c} stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
          <text x={n.x} y="270" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">{n.y}</text>
          {n.t.split('\n').map((line, i) => (
            <text x={n.x} y={286 + i * 13} font-size="9.6" fill="#6b63a8" text-anchor="middle">{line}</text>
          ))}
        </g>
      ))}

      <!-- ============ 主线 ③：省 KV Cache（绿，工程主流） ============ -->
      <text x="20" y="368" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1a7a52">③ 省 KV Cache / 共享·低秩（推理工程主流）</text>
      <line x1="30" y1="398" x2="560" y2="398" stroke="#bfe6d3" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#tl-arrow)"></line>
      {[
        { x: 90,  y: '2019', t: 'MQA\n(PaLM/Falcon)', c: '#1a7a52' },
        { x: 290, y: '2023', t: 'GQA\n(LLaMA/Qwen/GLM/\nDeepSeek/Mistral)', c: '#1a7a52' },
        { x: 490, y: '2024', t: 'MLA 低秩潜变量\n(DeepSeek-V2/V3/R1)', c: '#0f9d68' },
      ].map((n) => (
        <g>
          <line x1={n.x} y1="386" x2={n.x} y2="410" stroke="#bfe6d3" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
          <circle cx={n.x} cy="398" r="6" fill="#fff" stroke={n.c} stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
          <text x={n.x} y="426" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">{n.y}</text>
          {n.t.split('\n').map((line, i) => (
            <text x={n.x} y={442 + i * 13} font-size="9.6" fill="#3f8065" text-anchor="middle">{line}</text>
          ))}
        </g>
      ))}

      <!-- 代表模型带 -->
      <rect x="30" y="500" width="540" height="44" rx="10" fill="#fffaf2" stroke="#f0d9a8" filter="url(#tl-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="44" y="520" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a6d1f">代表模型（<tspan fill="#b1521f">国产重点关注</tspan>）</text>
      <text x="44" y="537" font-size="10.5" fill="#7a6535">GPT · PaLM · Falcon · LLaMA · Mistral · Gemini ｜ 国产：<tspan font-weight="bold" fill="#b1521f">Qwen 通义 · DeepSeek · GLM 智谱 · Kimi 月之暗面 · 豆包 字节</tspan></text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
